@* What the server answers for an address the site does not publish (written as /404.html). The present website has
   no page of its own for this: it shows the framework's "404 | This page could not be found." inside the frame. *@
<main class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-blue-50 dark:from-gray-950 dark:to-gray-900">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-8 py-12 text-center">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100 mb-4">404</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">This page could not be found.</p>
        <a href="/" class="inline-block mt-4 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline">The Strong Rope</a>
    </div>
</main>
